# Push updates to GitHub

Remote: `https://github.com/NeverSMILE0825/Income-Tracker.git` (`origin`).

After a requested code change is finished, commit it and push to `origin`.

- Include the files that belong to the change. Leave out `data/`, `*.db`, `.env`, and anything that holds an API key or the local transaction cache.
- Do not force-push. Do not change git config.
- If the turn only answered a question and did not change project files, do not commit.
